    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/car-repair-mechanic/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Car Repair Mechanic theme is a powerful and flexible solution crafted for auto repair shops, car garages, car wash services, mechanic workshops, automobile centers, and other vehicle service providers. Perfect for car maintenance, tyre and brake services, vehicle diagnostics, truck and bike repair, auto painting, body shops, and car rental businesses, this theme delivers a professional platform to showcase automotive expertise. It features a purpose-driven layout with sections for business hours, free consultations, service listings, testimonials, and image sliders to effectively promote your services. The theme is responsive, fast-loading, and SEO-optimized, ensuring top performance and visibility across devices. It supports e-commerce integration, allowing you to sell automotive parts, accessories, or maintenance packages online. Compatibility with essential plugins like Contact Form 7 for booking and inquiries, WPML for multilingual websites, and Yoast SEO for optimization makes customization effortless. Built with clean and secure coding, the Car Repair Mechanic theme offers smooth navigation, one-click installation, and detailed documentation. Whether for small car service businesses or professional vehicle repair companies, it provides a mobile-ready, search-optimized, and visually appealing platform to attract more customers and grow your automotive brand.  View: https://preview.themesglance.com/car-repair-mechanic-pro/"
    },
